                            </span>

                            <h3>
                                Study Skills
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Learners develop practical skills that
                                can help them become more confident and
                                independent students.
                            </p>

                            <ul>
                                <li>Time management</li>
                                <li>Note-taking</li>
                                <li>Study techniques</li>
                                <li>Goal setting</li>
                            </ul>

                        </div>

                    </article>

                </div>


